      "id": "blk_5f2ced6d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "相传藏于桑古伊斯狩原地下深处的前代文明遗迹，入口位于受蚀地区域，曾是七丘三位英雄王的造访之所。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_7204c655",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "传说进入玛涅斯之底者，能聆听到英雄王们的低语，并由此获得堪比英雄王的力量。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_4364442b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "亦有人称，正因历代英雄王皆踏足于此，玛涅斯之底即为英雄成王的必由之路。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
